        "title": "Nervous System",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCEREBRAL CORTEX (4 lobes per hemisphere)\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  FRONTAL           │  PARIETAL                              │\n│  Primary motor     │  Primary somatosensory (postcentral)   │\n│  (precentral gyrus)│  Spatial processing                    │\n│  Prefrontal:       │  Body image                            │\n│  executive, working│                                        │\n│  memory, inhibition│                                        │\n├─────────────────────┤─────────────────────────────────────  │\n│  TEMPORAL          │  OCCIPITAL                             │\n│  Primary auditory  │  Primary visual (V1: striate cortex)   │\n│  Wernicke's area   │  V2–V5: motion, color, object          │\n│  (language compreh)│  recognition                           │\n│  Hippocampus       │                                        │\n│  (memory encoding) │                                        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
